# Project Conventions

## Stack
- Frontend: 
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Tailwind CSS
- React and Vite
- Javascript

## Conventions
- Use functional components with hooks
- Keep files single-purpose, avoid deep abstraction
- Commit messages follow Conventional Commits (feat:, fix:, docs:, chore:)
- Forms must use react-hook-form and zod for validations
- Write clean code with interactive UI
- There should be separate components files in components' folder for clear understanding